  "assumptions": [
    "Raw word offsets are traced from the actual TypeScript mixer and PCM/BADP decoders; the corresponding output-checksum and end-status results are compared with the actual C++ mixer. The current case count is emitted by the report, not fixed here.",
    "Per-voice adjacent-byte assembly uses a one-word latch within an output epoch. RAM latches do not persist across epochs; intervening committed writes must invalidate/update them.",
    "Optional4/16-word per-voice fully associative LRU caches apply only to fixed immutable system/cartridge ROM. They are proposals, not implemented hardware. Entries are tied to bound source/socket/address and reset/rebind invalidation. No future trace addresses or speculative prefetch are used.",
    "Synchronous voices start at the same actual trace phase. Spread voices are existing warm playback offset by17epochs pervoice, up to255; no trace is cyclically wrapped or silently extended.",
    "LocalRAM and externalSYS/CAD are physically independent paths. Each is screened against768clocks; combined nonoverlapped work is also shown. A complete concurrent APU scheduler is not implemented by this analysis.",
    "Uploads are disjoint inactive-buffer physical writeback pressure: full16word/512clock batches yield alternating16/32word audio windows, average24. Both relative burst phases must be checked. No early visible active-source writes are authorised.",
    "The optional9clocks perROMmiss is an explicit competing minimum-size CORE SYS packet sensitivity, not a measured arbitration guarantee or required workload.",
    "A fitting memory window is not proof of arithmetic, coldstart, live MMIO latency, actual pad/PCB STA or coherent batch publication. ",
    "Warm-result classification excludes only outputepoch0; its actual traffic and cold PLAY traffic remain separately reported. No arbitrary multi-frame warmup, prefetch or startup latency permission is assumed.",
    "Localpeak checks place a32-word upload burst at any outputepoch for repeated full16-word batches; average remains24writes/window. This selected writeback screen is not an all-pattern arrival bound; variable admitted batches are qualified separately by the physical publication owner."
  ],
  "unclosed": [
    "Cold PLAY/source rebind/START_SAMPLE seeks and synchronous many-voice starts; no new tolerated launch delay is inferred.",
    "Complete transfer FIFO/MMIO, DMA_READ and voice integration of the separately implemented write-publication/render-snapshot owner; this source-demand model does not qualify those paths.",
    "Complete voice/transfer arbitration, PCM/ROM byte paths, fixed-ROM cache implementation and full physical audio pipeline; the local BADP byte/recurrence path is qualified separately.",
    "Live APU source-rebind/seek MMIO cannot retain SYS DATA while depending on its own ROM fetch over the same bus.",
    "BADP arithmetic work at high/reverse rates, filters/gain, coefficient/register edge timing, command execution and silicon timing/power. Per-frame nibble/product demand is exposed, not assigned magic zero-cycle execution."
  ],
